# Blog source artwork — the multi-MB originals authors drop in. The optimised
# WebP the site actually serves lives in public/ and IS committed; keeping the
# ~50MB of PNGs out means they don't sit in git history forever. Delete this
# rule if the originals need to be versioned.
content/blog-source/images/

# 4K master for the Raksha Bandhan intro. The deployed encodes live in
# public/rakhi-intro-*.mp4; this 53MB source is kept out of git and out of
# public/ so it is never shipped to a visitor.
video-master/

# Obsidian dev log — local-only notes about changes made in this repo.
# Never pushed: it is a personal working record, not project source.
Dev Log/
